  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "POSTing FOXML without a PID but with the pid included as part of the request gives an error that the PID is malformed",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Tried doing the following using Firefox Poster:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "POST to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects/newpid:foo"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects/newpid:foo",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "with FOXML as request data (note that no PID is defined):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<foxml:digitalObject VERSION=\"1.1\" xmlns:foxml=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/foxml#\" xmlns:xsi=\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/foxml# ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/foxml1-1.xsd"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.fedora.info/definitions/1/0/foxml1-1.xsd",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<foxml:objectProperties>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<foxml:property NAME=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#state\" VALUE=\"Active\"/>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<foxml:property NAME=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#label\" VALUE=\"Label\"/>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</foxml:objectProperties>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</foxml:digitalObject>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Response:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "fedora.server.errors.GeneralException: Ingest failed: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Caused by: fedora.common.FaultException: Malformed PID: PID delimiter (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "id": "1f642",
        "shortName": ":slight_smile:",
        "text": "🙂"
       },
       "type": "emoji"
      },
      {
       "text": " is missing.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.common.PID.getInstance(PID.java:77)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at fedora.server.validation.ValidationUtility.validateReservedDatastreams(ValidationUtility.java:81)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "What should happen in this case is that the PID provided as part of the REST request should be used as the object's PID upon ingest.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
